<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89703" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσλείπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leave on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ μεσογονατίῳ τὸ πρὸς τοὺς βλαστοὺς
					γόνυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					4.11.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>leave unworked</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἢ συνελεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.3073.23
				</span></i>
			 (Lebad., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., <i>to be lacking</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ προσλεῖπον τῆς φύσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1337a2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ προσλείψαντα τοῦ ἔργου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IGRom.</u>
					4.845
				</span></i>
			 (Laodicea ad Lycum, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>).</div>
